      "uid": "zhcn:1f7ee82a01a871af92b8a889",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "DJ仔细观察着台下的气氛。慢慢地加快节奏，\n在客人跟上节奏后做出最热烈的演出──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aeb5988366b1b128b903965e2214309b02fdd8d7a912c5ca7f9b072575b1dbd",
